== Description ==

'''Blackwood''' is a raw material in ''[[Human Host]]'', harvested from the world (trees, rocks, salvage). It appears as an ingredient in 18 downstream recipes at the [[Cutting Workbench]], including [[Ebony Wood]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

